{"ID":"20240118151102-wc7kcni","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151102-wc7kcni","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151102-wc7kcni\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151102-thhxxou\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122140246-7xvxajj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151102-thhxxou\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:28,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:28\u0026#125;","title":"231猬皮（刺猬皮）","type":"doc","updated":"20240202082452"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151102-thhxxou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151102-thhxxou","updated":"20240202082452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，平，无毒。治五痔，阴蚀，下血赤白，五色血汁不止，阴肿痛引腰背。酒者杀之。生川谷、田野。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140231-lgjnzb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140231-lgjnzb3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】山地多有之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140235-kfimy5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140235-kfimy5c"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性平。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140237-8i3ni3q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140237-8i3ni3q"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】猬皮治五痔，泻血，阴肿痛及反胃，炙为末或烧灰服。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140241-ezyr1o0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140241-ezyr1o0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗腹痛疝积，烧灰酒服。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140243-t673ayh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140243-t673ayh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【毅明】治反胃吐食。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140244-hrczuf1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140244-hrczuf1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一般一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140245-26p1ufc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140245-26p1ufc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】禁生用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140230-ka5j74b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140230-ka5j74b"}},{"ID":"20240122140246-mqv0t8d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140246-mqv0t8d"}},{"ID":"20240122140246-7xvxajj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140246-7xvxajj","updated":"20240202082425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"231味，这猬皮就是刺猬皮，就是你看它那个身上的毛就是刺猬。我们会用到刺猬皮最多的地方是用在痔疮。那你说老师痔疮不是地榆吗？老师怎样治疗痔疮？那赤小豆去湿，地榆止血，刺猬呢来活血化瘀。长痔疮的时候，里面瘘管会很多，刺猬可以到所有的地方去，用刺猬皮来收敛，赤小豆去湿，地榆止血，这样就会配合得很好。治疗痔疮的手法很多，你看猬皮治五痔，我们在治疗痔疮的时候，你不要听分很多菊花痔啦，樱花痔呀分很多，你看针灸里面有四十九种痔疮的名称，你不要真正的去背，不要去背。痔疮我们分内痔跟外痔就讲完了，名称不一样用药是一样，你不要管那么多名称，尽量减化。刺猬皮呢止流血不止、痔中痛，如果配合针灸，那效果更快。那如果是外痔，发起来的肿块硬在那边很痛，你用针刺放血，放血的时候他痛就消了很多，你再加些内服的药。针灸针下孔最，承山。把刺猬烤干磨成灰，跟着酒一起吃，不要生用哦，动物的皮生用不得了，里面有各种毒之类的很脏，要把刺猬皮弄干净，把它刷洗干净烧烤以后再去弄。刺猬皮一定要制过后用，不能生用。刺猬皮治疗痔疮，我们最主要的主力是使用在痔疮，疝气，因为刺猬钻的力量非常的强，一定要制过用。"}]}]}